WEBVTT

01:34.640 --> 01:36.200
What a beautiful gown!

01:36.710 --> 01:37.640
I heard they specially hired

01:37.640 --> 01:38.479
royal tailors who make robes

01:38.479 --> 01:39.509
for ladies of the court.

01:39.789 --> 01:41.200
The embroideresses are also invited from

01:41.200 --> 01:42.560
the finest embroidery houses in Jiangnan.

01:44.400 --> 01:45.200
See?

01:45.509 --> 01:46.950
The guest of honor is Mrs. Chen,

01:47.280 --> 01:48.789
from a noble household in the capital.

01:49.200 --> 01:50.120
This Miss Gu

01:50.200 --> 01:51.430
sure has great connections.

02:24.630 --> 02:28.120
Now the veil is lifted, revealing her graceful face,

02:28.280 --> 02:30.520
to receive her coming-of-age ceremony.

03:36.310 --> 03:38.000
Let the maiden receive the hairpin.

03:38.190 --> 03:41.120
Mrs. Chen, please purify your hands.

03:51.000 --> 03:52.560
First adornment.

03:54.800 --> 03:57.150
On this auspicious day and hour,

03:57.430 --> 03:59.960
we begin by adding the first hairpin.

04:00.590 --> 04:02.560
Lay aside your childish ways,

04:02.680 --> 04:05.030
and uphold virtuous conduct.

04:05.310 --> 04:10.470
May you enjoy longevity and boundless blessings.

04:10.870 --> 04:12.150
Second adornment.

04:13.190 --> 04:18.360
I add your second hairpin.

04:19.120 --> 04:24.040
Bear yourself with dignity.

04:24.510 --> 04:26.920
May you live a long life,

04:27.310 --> 04:31.390
blessed with fortune forevermore.

04:49.000 --> 04:50.310
Third adornment.

05:25.680 --> 05:28.070
The three hairpin rites are complete.

05:28.270 --> 05:31.040
Rituals are all fulfilled.

05:31.270 --> 05:33.630
No longer a child, you stand as a lady,

05:33.750 --> 05:35.430
to abide by all maidenly etiquette.

05:35.750 --> 05:38.120
Conduct yourself with grace and caution.

05:44.270 --> 05:46.920
Now, bow to your parents.

05:58.240 --> 05:59.510
Bow.

06:35.680 --> 06:38.800
May you walk the path of virtue and ritual,

06:39.950 --> 06:42.560
and bring harmony to your future home.

06:43.630 --> 06:44.750
Though I am not wise,

06:45.310 --> 06:46.430
I shall keep your teachings close to heart.

06:53.390 --> 06:54.510
Hold on.

06:58.680 --> 06:59.600
I nearly forgot.

06:59.800 --> 07:00.750
Mrs. Gu asked me

07:00.750 --> 07:02.000
to bring you a ceremonial gift.

07:02.950 --> 07:03.870
Who is that woman?

07:04.240 --> 07:06.360
Sounds like one of the Gu's concubines.

07:06.950 --> 07:08.240
If so,

07:08.830 --> 07:09.600
Miss Gu

07:09.680 --> 07:11.510
will have to kowtow to her.

07:11.750 --> 07:13.390
Indeed. Yet she cannot refuse it.

07:13.600 --> 07:14.950
It's a gift from her birth mother.

07:15.190 --> 07:16.750
This ought to be interesting.

07:17.720 --> 07:18.600
A gift from my mother,

07:19.160 --> 07:20.510
sent by you on her behalf?

07:20.830 --> 07:21.510
It is.

07:22.480 --> 07:23.510
Why is Han's gift

07:23.920 --> 07:25.510
for Jinzhao

07:26.070 --> 07:27.720
delivered by her?

07:28.680 --> 07:30.120
Ma'am,

07:30.510 --> 07:32.240
Mrs. Gu had intended to come herself,

07:32.560 --> 07:34.040
yet her health has long been frail.

07:34.240 --> 07:35.310
The physician said

07:35.630 --> 07:37.560
it is an ailment she has had since birth.

07:38.040 --> 07:40.630
I suppose when you were young,

07:40.720 --> 07:41.950
you were too occupied with business...

07:44.510 --> 07:45.159
Anyway,

07:45.390 --> 07:46.800
she knows I handle matters properly,

07:46.920 --> 07:47.920
so she entrusted me with this.

07:49.920 --> 07:51.310
How dare she insult my grandmother!

07:52.680 --> 07:54.270
Though I grew up in Tongzhou,

07:54.480 --> 07:55.480
I have always heard the Gu family

07:55.630 --> 07:56.950
upholds strict etiquette, with husband

07:57.390 --> 07:59.000
and wife respecting each other deeply.

08:00.870 --> 08:01.920
Seeing it today,

08:02.040 --> 08:02.950
it is just as I've heard. Not only are

08:03.190 --> 08:04.870
master and mistress harmonious,

08:05.310 --> 08:06.600
even this concubine

08:06.750 --> 08:07.920
knows proper manners well.

08:08.600 --> 08:09.750
She took the trouble

08:09.870 --> 08:10.510
to personally carry

08:10.510 --> 08:12.190
the gift my mother sent me.

08:13.000 --> 08:14.000
I never thought

08:14.430 --> 08:16.800
three could share such mutual respect.

08:17.720 --> 08:18.680
Such family virtue

08:18.870 --> 08:20.040
ought to be known far and wide,

08:20.390 --> 08:21.800
a tale worthy of praise.

08:26.000 --> 08:26.430
You...

08:27.240 --> 08:27.720
Gu Dezhao...

08:28.560 --> 08:29.390
Sir.

08:40.080 --> 08:42.270
Three sharing mutual respect?

08:42.840 --> 08:43.440
Well said.

08:44.150 --> 08:44.670
You shall be rewarded.

08:46.150 --> 08:47.150
Insolent child!

08:47.630 --> 08:49.510
How dare you speak so rudely!

08:51.670 --> 08:52.720
Hold your tongue at once!

08:53.030 --> 08:53.910
What?

08:55.270 --> 08:56.320
You dare insult

08:56.320 --> 08:57.840
the heir of Lord Changxing?

08:58.200 --> 08:59.510
Kneel and beg forgiveness at once!

09:01.910 --> 09:04.080
You are the Young Lord of Changxing Manor?

09:04.480 --> 09:06.080
Ye Xian?

09:09.960 --> 09:11.030
How can that be?

09:12.790 --> 09:15.200
He's indeed the Young Lord of Changxing.

09:19.840 --> 09:20.840
So you recognize me.

09:25.080 --> 09:26.960
One as noble as you,

09:27.270 --> 09:29.030
dim as my eyes are,

09:29.360 --> 09:30.630
I could still tell.

09:30.870 --> 09:31.840
I only feared

09:32.030 --> 09:33.360
you hid your identity on purpose,

09:33.630 --> 09:34.870
so I dared not speak out.

09:38.030 --> 09:38.960
Greetings, Young Lord.

09:39.150 --> 09:40.630
Greetings, Young Lord.

09:42.000 --> 09:42.670
Never mind.

09:43.600 --> 09:44.120
I simply hate

09:44.120 --> 09:45.360
tedious formalities,

09:45.630 --> 09:46.790
hence why I kept my status hidden.

09:47.480 --> 09:48.320
No need to make a fuss.

09:53.390 --> 09:54.320
Sir,

09:55.120 --> 09:57.550
I truly did not know your identity.

09:57.630 --> 10:00.390
I beg you to forgive my ignorance.

10:03.870 --> 10:04.670
Rise.

10:05.150 --> 10:06.720
Thank you, sir.

10:09.870 --> 10:10.630
Be off now.

10:17.440 --> 10:18.960
It was merely a misunderstanding.

10:19.150 --> 10:20.440
Let it pass.

10:21.510 --> 10:22.510
Well? Then this is

10:23.000 --> 10:24.840
quite a huge misunderstanding indeed.

10:25.270 --> 10:26.360
Put aside the Young Lord for now,

10:26.910 --> 10:28.790
just think of your superior, Sir Chen.

10:32.320 --> 10:33.080
If not for

10:33.080 --> 10:34.120
the Ji family's sake,

10:34.670 --> 10:35.720
any other official

10:36.000 --> 10:37.390
seeing your conduct would never

10:37.790 --> 10:39.150
entrust you with important duties.

10:39.670 --> 10:40.750
Perhaps, they would even

10:41.150 --> 10:42.270
file an accusation against you.

10:42.440 --> 10:42.870
You…

10:50.320 --> 10:50.750
Well...

10:57.030 --> 10:58.360
Yeah, yeah.

10:59.000 --> 10:59.390
Help yourselves.

10:59.550 --> 11:00.030
Eat.

11:00.120 --> 11:00.720
Here.

11:05.960 --> 11:06.670
Uncle,

11:06.960 --> 11:08.000
I've got some news.

11:14.360 --> 11:14.870
Excuse us.

11:20.390 --> 11:21.390
Please eat.

11:21.390 --> 11:21.840
Here.

11:22.630 --> 11:23.320
Do help yourselves.

11:23.670 --> 11:24.600
Go on, go on.

11:28.480 --> 11:29.550
Sir,

11:30.200 --> 11:32.440
please forgive us

11:32.670 --> 11:34.320
for any poor hospitality today.

11:34.720 --> 11:35.440
Jinzhao,

11:35.720 --> 11:37.080
greet the Young Lord.

11:38.510 --> 11:39.960
Greetings, Young Lord.

11:43.000 --> 11:44.750
You needn't call me Young Lord.

11:45.510 --> 11:46.790
Xian is your cousin,

11:47.360 --> 11:48.550
and my own nephew.

11:49.360 --> 11:50.440
You ought to follow him

11:51.480 --> 11:52.600
and call me Uncle.

11:53.150 --> 11:53.600
You…

11:56.510 --> 11:57.440
Jinzhao.

12:03.120 --> 12:03.510
Well…

12:03.550 --> 12:05.360
We're about the same age

12:06.360 --> 12:07.360
after all...

12:13.840 --> 12:14.720
You're right.

12:15.720 --> 12:17.510
Greetings, Uncle.

12:17.840 --> 12:19.000
Uncle, I wish you well.

12:20.670 --> 12:21.150
Good girl.

12:24.670 --> 12:25.630
As my uncle,

12:25.910 --> 12:26.910
meeting me for the first time,

12:27.030 --> 12:28.080
have you prepared a greeting gift?

12:28.240 --> 12:29.360
Jinzhao.

12:39.390 --> 12:39.750
Uncle.

12:39.750 --> 12:40.360
Sir!

12:49.630 --> 12:50.320
Why so flustered?

12:51.870 --> 12:53.670
This is a dagger I carry with me.

12:54.360 --> 12:55.440
Now,

12:56.480 --> 12:57.270
it's yours.

13:10.270 --> 13:11.440
Handle it carefully.

13:11.750 --> 13:12.670
This blade

13:13.080 --> 13:14.270
is coated with poison.

13:18.600 --> 13:19.870
Poison's fine by me.

13:20.480 --> 13:21.960
It's mine now anyway.

13:22.510 --> 13:24.480
Some people better watch their step.

13:24.480 --> 13:25.240
Jinzhao,

13:25.550 --> 13:26.550
do not be disrespectful.

13:36.840 --> 13:38.480
The third assassination attempt?

13:38.840 --> 13:40.750
Counting the well poisoning,

13:41.200 --> 13:43.120
it's already the fourth.

13:46.360 --> 13:48.200
Should we send Jinzhao

13:48.480 --> 13:50.390
to the Gu Manor in the capital?

13:51.270 --> 13:53.080
It is also her home.

13:53.510 --> 13:54.910
Follow your own judgement.

13:56.080 --> 13:57.510
I gave my word to my mentor.

13:58.080 --> 14:00.030
Tongzhou is the first step

14:04.600 --> 14:06.200
of land equalization.

14:06.550 --> 14:07.720
No matter the cost,

14:07.960 --> 14:09.000
success is the only option.

14:13.510 --> 14:14.030
Sir.

14:32.750 --> 14:33.440
Hyah!

14:34.510 --> 14:35.670
Hyah! Hyah! Hyah!

14:37.320 --> 14:39.720
Hyah! Hyah! Hyah!

14:41.870 --> 14:44.670
I really don't see why you're doing this.

14:45.720 --> 14:48.390
We're just measuring the land first.

14:49.440 --> 14:52.320
As long as your conscience is clear,

14:52.600 --> 14:54.200
the acreage and the land registry

14:54.390 --> 14:55.870
should match.

14:59.840 --> 15:00.550
This way.

15:00.550 --> 15:10.720
Moonlight spills on stone steps and windows,

15:10.720 --> 15:18.320
Candles cast a chill over painted screens.

15:18.320 --> 15:26.120
I linger to savour the night,

15:26.120 --> 15:31.440
strolling the courtyard beneath the moon.

15:31.440 --> 15:36.550
My silk socks grow cold amid the mossy dew.

15:37.120 --> 15:38.030
How are things at the palace?

15:38.240 --> 15:39.030
Sir.

15:39.360 --> 15:40.360
All military nobles have been there,

15:40.870 --> 15:43.000
save the Lord of Changxing.

15:44.120 --> 15:46.670
Changxing means to be a loyal minister.

15:46.910 --> 15:47.670
Pity though,

15:48.510 --> 15:49.440
a loyalist

15:50.000 --> 15:50.870
can only thrive

15:51.240 --> 15:53.080
under a wise sovereign.

15:53.840 --> 15:54.480
Otherwise,

15:54.480 --> 15:55.750
he'll only trap himself

15:55.750 --> 15:56.630
into a dead end.

15:58.320 --> 16:01.080
So Prince Glorian leads the protest?

16:01.240 --> 16:01.720
Yes.

16:03.270 --> 16:04.030
Brother,

16:05.080 --> 16:06.240
those land registers were drawn up

16:06.600 --> 16:08.320
at the founding of Great Yan.

16:08.960 --> 16:10.200
All these years later,

16:10.670 --> 16:11.840
the population has grown,

16:12.270 --> 16:13.960
naturally expanding land holdings.

16:14.720 --> 16:16.910
Now taxing by actual acreage,

16:17.200 --> 16:18.200
large clans with many households

16:18.200 --> 16:20.200
will barely scrape by.

16:20.550 --> 16:21.870
Isn't this no different

16:22.240 --> 16:23.630
from ruining their families?

16:25.030 --> 16:26.910
Prince Glorian is targeting me.

16:27.200 --> 16:28.550
Though he has no proof yet,

16:28.870 --> 16:30.550
he must already suspect

16:31.600 --> 16:33.120
that I had his son killed.

16:34.510 --> 16:35.910
He only suspects it,

16:37.390 --> 16:39.200
but he doesn't dare speak of it openly.

16:41.270 --> 16:42.960
He fears we will truly investigate

16:42.960 --> 16:44.840
his ties to the southwest bandits.

16:45.790 --> 16:47.320
That's why he's making a fuss

16:47.480 --> 16:49.240
by striking at the new tax reform.

16:49.240 --> 16:51.030
This move of his is truly ruthless.

16:51.240 --> 16:53.600
All military nobles have knelt in protest.

16:54.390 --> 16:55.390
His Majesty

16:58.390 --> 16:59.600
may not be able to hold out.

17:00.600 --> 17:03.790
Brother, revoke the new tax reform.

17:05.510 --> 17:09.109
Your Majesty, revoke the new tax reform.

17:16.640 --> 17:17.480
It seems

17:17.589 --> 17:19.829
your old acquaintance Nie Fengming

17:20.240 --> 17:22.829
is also among those protesting nobles.

17:39.550 --> 17:40.160
I, Nie Fengming,

17:40.270 --> 17:42.000
Cloud Cavalry Captain First Class,

17:42.240 --> 17:44.590
beg Your Majesty to abolish the new tax reform.

17:45.070 --> 17:46.550
Punish those who started this trouble.

17:46.720 --> 17:48.750
Fu Hailian, Chen Yanyun.

17:53.830 --> 17:54.550
Your Majesty,

17:54.920 --> 17:55.640
I believe

17:55.640 --> 17:56.920
the so-called new tax reform

17:57.240 --> 17:58.070
is merely a scheme of

17:58.070 --> 17:59.720
Fu Hailian, Chen Yanyun and their clique.

18:00.110 --> 18:01.480
Fu Hailian craves Your Majesty's favor,

18:01.480 --> 18:03.590
seeking undeserved merit and deceiving you.

18:03.720 --> 18:04.790
He seeks to control the court,

18:05.070 --> 18:06.110
turning the imperial court

18:06.110 --> 18:07.400
into his one-man rule.

18:07.720 --> 18:08.640
What did you say?

18:13.110 --> 18:13.920
Did you arrange

18:14.110 --> 18:15.310
all of this?

18:16.480 --> 18:17.550
How could I

18:17.550 --> 18:18.480
have arranged it?

18:18.830 --> 18:19.640
Your Majesty,

18:20.030 --> 18:20.960
all us military nobles,

18:20.960 --> 18:22.110
trace back three generations,

18:22.350 --> 18:23.790
were all peasants.

18:24.510 --> 18:25.110
True.

18:25.680 --> 18:27.590
We do own some farmland,

18:27.830 --> 18:29.110
yet these lands

18:29.550 --> 18:31.590
are all we have left.

18:32.110 --> 18:32.750
Wait, hold on.

18:34.400 --> 18:35.310
What do you mean?

18:36.790 --> 18:38.400
"All we have left"?

18:38.960 --> 18:40.680
What else

18:41.070 --> 18:42.000
do you want to have left?

18:42.310 --> 18:43.070
Well…

18:43.790 --> 18:45.310
I don't need to spell it out, do I?

18:45.440 --> 18:45.880
No.

18:46.200 --> 18:47.000
Speak plainly.

18:47.680 --> 18:49.000
You will explain it to me fully.

18:49.310 --> 18:49.790
Speak!

18:51.680 --> 18:53.310
The Late Ancestor swore an oath

18:53.920 --> 18:55.440
before all military generals,

18:55.440 --> 18:56.680
to fight for the realm side by side,

18:56.680 --> 18:57.720
and rule it side by side.

18:58.000 --> 18:58.880
But what became of it?

18:59.160 --> 19:00.720
The realm now belongs solely to the Li.

19:01.270 --> 19:02.400
What about us?

19:02.400 --> 19:03.680
If we claim a little more land,

19:03.680 --> 19:04.790
build a few more mansions,

19:05.030 --> 19:06.590
or indulge our servants a little,

19:06.590 --> 19:07.640
we face the court's

19:07.640 --> 19:08.510
harsh punishment.

19:09.070 --> 19:10.240
You...

19:11.270 --> 19:12.480
No, Your Majesty,

19:12.680 --> 19:13.590
We meant no such thing.

19:14.070 --> 19:14.750
Fine.

19:15.790 --> 19:16.510
Guards!

19:17.240 --> 19:18.200
Drag him out!

19:18.310 --> 19:19.200
Now!

19:19.350 --> 19:19.880
Yes.

19:21.000 --> 19:21.640
Take him away!

19:22.110 --> 19:22.830
Your Majesty.

19:23.270 --> 19:24.000
Your Majesty.

19:24.550 --> 19:26.400
- Greed never ends.
- Your Majesty.

19:27.110 --> 19:28.440
- You people
- Your Majesty.

19:28.440 --> 19:30.000
have forgotten your roots!

19:31.790 --> 19:32.440
Very well.

19:32.750 --> 19:34.550
Even if I abandon land equalization,

19:35.550 --> 19:37.680
you shall never be grateful to me.

19:38.680 --> 19:39.270
Then I

19:40.510 --> 19:42.200
need not spare any leniency for you.

19:44.030 --> 19:44.680
Yang Song.

19:45.720 --> 19:46.270
Yes.

19:46.400 --> 19:47.480
Issue an imperial edict openly.

19:47.790 --> 19:48.790
As of today,

19:49.720 --> 19:51.590
within one year, the entire Great Yan

19:51.880 --> 19:53.400
shall enforce the new tax reform.

19:54.160 --> 19:56.310
Carry out nationwide land equalization.

20:04.920 --> 20:06.240
I don't want to leave.

20:07.000 --> 20:08.750
I was sent to Tongzhou

20:08.750 --> 20:10.000
when I was barely a month old.

20:10.510 --> 20:12.070
I still remember clearly what happened

20:12.310 --> 20:12.790
when I was six.

20:12.790 --> 20:13.960
Not a single detail is forgotten.

20:14.480 --> 20:15.920
I was just a little child,

20:16.550 --> 20:17.920
who finally found my way home,

20:18.160 --> 20:19.070
yet my own father would not

20:19.270 --> 20:20.680
even let me step through the gate.

20:21.000 --> 20:22.030
Now the court inspection draws near,

20:22.030 --> 20:23.030
afraid of being impeached,

20:23.270 --> 20:24.440
he suddenly wants me back.

20:24.960 --> 20:25.350
How can the world

20:25.350 --> 20:26.590
allow such selfishness?

20:27.200 --> 20:27.880
Alright.

20:27.880 --> 20:29.550
Besides, I already broke with him

20:29.830 --> 20:31.160
at my coming-of-age ceremony.

20:31.750 --> 20:32.960
You saw it all.

20:33.240 --> 20:34.550
Why still insist I go?

20:34.790 --> 20:35.920
I know.

20:37.750 --> 20:40.110
You've suffered wrongs.

20:40.440 --> 20:41.480
I'm not asking you

20:41.480 --> 20:43.110
to reconcile with your father.

20:43.550 --> 20:44.310
But,

20:45.110 --> 20:47.000
you still have to go.

20:47.640 --> 20:48.510
Why?

20:48.680 --> 20:50.960
Your father may not be a good man,

20:52.000 --> 20:52.790
yet

20:53.350 --> 20:54.960
your mother still lives.

20:55.680 --> 20:57.110
She lies gravely ill.

20:57.400 --> 20:58.680
As her daughter,

20:58.680 --> 21:01.030
you ought to attend to her.

21:01.590 --> 21:03.880
Think of it as doing this for me,

21:04.110 --> 21:05.510
to look after your mother.

21:06.880 --> 21:08.750
Do this one favor for me,

21:08.750 --> 21:09.590
okay?

21:18.440 --> 21:20.750
Can't you fall asleep, Miss?

21:23.510 --> 21:24.720
Yeah.

21:25.750 --> 21:27.440
I truly don't wish to go.

21:28.240 --> 21:29.590
That residence in the capital

21:30.000 --> 21:31.160
is nothing

21:31.960 --> 21:33.310
but a stranger's place to me.

21:34.680 --> 21:35.310
Well...

21:35.960 --> 21:37.790
Shall we beg Mrs. Chen once more?

21:41.640 --> 21:43.200
I feel Grandmother

21:43.750 --> 21:45.510
doesn't truly want me to leave either.

21:46.920 --> 21:48.480
She just has no choice.

21:51.240 --> 21:52.310
Why is that?

21:53.440 --> 21:54.550
What else could it be?

21:55.070 --> 21:56.960
It must have something to do with him.

21:58.110 --> 21:58.920
Who?

22:01.350 --> 22:02.640
Who else?

22:06.240 --> 22:07.920
Chen Yanyun.

22:13.270 --> 22:14.550
Very well, I'll go.

22:15.000 --> 22:16.480
I fear no one.

22:17.000 --> 22:17.720
Gu Dezhao said

22:17.720 --> 22:19.310
I hinder his official career.

22:20.510 --> 22:22.110
Then I'll go ruin it for real.

22:23.110 --> 22:24.030
Might as well

22:24.550 --> 22:25.880
live up to the reputation.

22:38.750 --> 22:40.830
If you are wronged in the Gu Manor,

22:41.200 --> 22:43.110
do not keep it to yourself.

22:43.270 --> 22:44.200
Come tell me.

22:44.480 --> 22:46.480
I will stand firmly by you.

22:47.960 --> 22:49.880
I'll send Luo Yongping with you.

22:50.240 --> 22:52.350
He's seen much of the world outside.

22:53.310 --> 22:54.070
Also,

22:54.480 --> 22:55.480
Yao

22:56.240 --> 22:58.790
will visit you in the capital often.

23:00.400 --> 23:02.510
Rest assured, Grandmother.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.590
With my temper,

23:04.790 --> 23:06.240
no one dares bully me.

23:07.880 --> 23:08.640
Go now.

23:49.440 --> 23:50.200
Keep up.

24:07.030 --> 24:08.590
Stop, stop.

24:08.960 --> 24:09.550
Grandmother.

24:10.110 --> 24:11.110
Grandmother.

24:16.240 --> 24:17.350
Grandmother.

24:56.750 --> 24:57.720
Grandmother.

24:58.400 --> 24:59.640
I hate to part with you.

24:59.960 --> 25:02.070
Please take good care of yourself.

25:03.070 --> 25:05.200
I hate to see you leave too.

25:06.440 --> 25:06.960
Alright.

25:07.750 --> 25:08.440
Rise.

25:30.350 --> 25:30.920
Miss,

25:31.550 --> 25:33.240
we've fallen quite far behind.

25:33.640 --> 25:35.030
Shouldn't we catch up?

25:35.400 --> 25:36.200
Otherwise Mr. Luo

25:36.200 --> 25:37.400
will start worrying.

25:37.590 --> 25:38.920
What's there to worry about?

25:39.590 --> 25:40.440
Afraid

25:41.160 --> 25:42.680
I will run away?

25:42.960 --> 25:44.270
I gave Grandmother my word,

25:44.480 --> 25:45.590
and I shall keep it.

25:46.270 --> 25:47.070
Yeah.

25:50.480 --> 25:51.400
What's wrong?

25:51.830 --> 25:53.830
The horse seems restless.

25:54.110 --> 25:55.640
It must be the heat.

25:56.480 --> 25:57.720
Slow down a little more.

25:58.440 --> 26:00.310
I think this horse feels just as I do,

26:00.880 --> 26:02.310
unwilling to head to that foul place.

26:02.960 --> 26:03.590
Yes.

26:14.880 --> 26:15.400
Sir.

26:15.790 --> 26:16.750
I'll go scout the road ahead.

26:23.310 --> 26:23.960
Uncle.

26:26.240 --> 26:27.590
Plenty of fine fruits at your manor,

26:27.590 --> 26:28.310
yet you refuse them

26:28.550 --> 26:29.960
and choose these wild ones instead.

26:40.200 --> 26:41.200
It's Jinzhao.

26:41.480 --> 26:42.640
Is she returning to the capital as well?

26:44.640 --> 26:45.640
Jinzhao.

26:48.400 --> 26:49.000
Miss.

26:49.400 --> 26:51.440
It's Young Master Xian.

27:01.750 --> 27:02.200
Uncle,

27:02.440 --> 27:03.510
put down the crossbow.

27:03.680 --> 27:04.880
Do not frighten her.

27:05.590 --> 27:06.880
She's not easily frightened.

27:07.400 --> 27:07.880
Miss.

27:07.920 --> 27:08.790
Pretend you saw nothing.

27:09.160 --> 27:09.880
Whip the horse and go.

27:10.030 --> 27:10.590
Hurry.

27:11.160 --> 27:11.720
Yes.

27:12.310 --> 27:12.920
Hyah!

27:13.590 --> 27:14.240
Uncle.

27:15.590 --> 27:16.030
Hyah!

27:17.720 --> 27:18.790
Interesting.

27:28.350 --> 27:29.310
Are you crazy?

27:48.720 --> 27:49.550
Qingpu.

27:50.030 --> 27:50.590
Miss!

27:50.920 --> 27:51.880
The horse is out of control!

28:07.070 --> 28:08.550
Miss, what are you doing?

28:08.720 --> 28:09.510
It's dangerous!

28:10.640 --> 28:11.550
Come back!

28:31.030 --> 28:32.070
Greetings, Young Lord.

28:34.200 --> 28:34.750
Miss.

28:34.830 --> 28:35.480
Mr. Luo.

28:35.590 --> 28:36.400
You've arrived just in time.

28:36.590 --> 28:37.720
Find a quiet place

28:38.200 --> 28:38.960
to give this horse

28:39.160 --> 28:40.110
a proper burial.

28:40.550 --> 28:41.070
Yes.

28:44.550 --> 28:45.030
Hey!

28:45.480 --> 28:46.400
Hold your tongue!

28:48.160 --> 28:48.880
What did you say?

28:49.350 --> 28:51.030
I would ask you to hold your peace.

28:51.240 --> 28:52.200
If you speak another word,

28:52.310 --> 28:53.350
I fear I shall not restrain myself

28:53.510 --> 28:55.240
and demand justice for this horse.

28:56.240 --> 28:57.240
Demand justice?

28:57.590 --> 28:59.240
Your horse went mad and charged at me first.

28:59.400 --> 29:00.200
If you hadn't loosed arrows

29:00.200 --> 29:01.110
to startle my horse,

29:01.310 --> 29:02.070
how could it have run wild

29:02.070 --> 29:02.750
and charged you?

29:03.550 --> 29:04.720
Who are you yelling at?

29:05.240 --> 29:06.240
If I'd known this would happen,

29:06.480 --> 29:07.590
I ought to have aimed straight for you.

29:15.440 --> 29:16.240
What are you doing?

29:25.750 --> 29:27.000
Sir, look.

29:28.440 --> 29:29.030
This...

29:29.160 --> 29:30.750
If I'm not mistaken,

29:31.200 --> 29:32.640
the steel needle will pierce deeper

29:32.640 --> 29:33.750
into the horse's belly as it runs.

29:34.310 --> 29:35.310
In less than half an hour,

29:35.440 --> 29:36.550
the horse would be overcome with agony

29:36.550 --> 29:37.350
and bolt out of control.

29:37.440 --> 29:38.400
Half an hour…

29:40.030 --> 29:41.350
In half an hour,

29:42.400 --> 29:43.750
there's a cliff ahead.

29:43.920 --> 29:44.440
What?

29:45.110 --> 29:45.640
If this horse

29:45.640 --> 29:46.880
runs wild near the cliff,

29:47.030 --> 29:47.720
that'll kill

29:47.720 --> 29:48.750
everyone in the carriage.

29:49.750 --> 29:50.310
Miss.

29:50.680 --> 29:51.550
Think carefully.

29:51.830 --> 29:52.920
Who have you offended that they

29:53.510 --> 29:55.070
would resort to such cruel tricks

29:55.480 --> 29:56.480
to get you killed?

29:57.550 --> 29:58.160
Mr. Luo.

29:58.960 --> 30:00.680
What do you make of this?

30:01.070 --> 30:02.200
I think it has to do

30:02.590 --> 30:04.750
with the land equalization policy.

30:05.510 --> 30:07.160
Someone wants to harm you

30:07.310 --> 30:08.400
to threaten the Ji family,

30:08.790 --> 30:10.200
and force your grandmother to back down.

30:10.590 --> 30:11.750
I see.

30:12.590 --> 30:13.720
No wonder Grandmother was in

30:13.880 --> 30:15.270
such a hurry to send me back to the capital.

30:16.030 --> 30:16.750
She feared I'd

30:16.750 --> 30:18.480
get dragged into the turmoil.

30:18.830 --> 30:19.680
Most likely.

30:21.070 --> 30:21.720
But… If even

30:22.070 --> 30:23.590
I've been targeted for assassination,

30:23.830 --> 30:25.350
Grandmother must be in far greater danger.

30:25.830 --> 30:26.350
No.

30:26.550 --> 30:27.310
I have to go back.

30:27.480 --> 30:28.200
Don't.

30:29.000 --> 30:29.960
Now you know the culprit's

30:29.960 --> 30:31.110
real target is your grandmother.

30:31.480 --> 30:32.270
If you rush back now,

30:32.270 --> 30:33.310
you'll only make things worse.

30:34.110 --> 30:34.720
You think your family

30:34.720 --> 30:35.720
doesn't have enough targets already?

30:43.590 --> 30:45.240
Young Lord really went to

30:45.240 --> 30:46.680
Jinzhao's coming-of-age ceremony?

30:47.960 --> 30:48.830
Of course he did.

30:49.720 --> 30:50.480
It's the first time

30:50.790 --> 30:52.400
I've ever seen him.

30:53.550 --> 30:54.640
But his manner...

30:57.030 --> 30:58.240
Huh,

30:59.350 --> 31:01.160
the Marquis of Changxing Manor

31:02.070 --> 31:03.550
has no worthy heir.

31:03.920 --> 31:05.510
No wonder you're unused to him.

31:05.680 --> 31:06.510
Young Lord

31:06.510 --> 31:07.440
despises

31:07.440 --> 31:08.550
official socializing.

31:09.070 --> 31:11.000
Every time he stays at the ancestral home,

31:11.160 --> 31:12.200
he only keeps company with Xian

31:12.200 --> 31:13.790
and Lian in the inner quarters.

31:13.920 --> 31:15.270
He can't stand the front courtyard.

31:16.000 --> 31:16.830
Still,

31:16.960 --> 31:19.270
he's quite kind to me.

31:20.880 --> 31:22.030
Speaking of the front courtyard,

31:22.350 --> 31:23.680
once Jinzhao arrives,

31:24.160 --> 31:24.830
tell her

31:25.200 --> 31:26.790
to come see me there first.

31:27.400 --> 31:28.070
Sir,

31:28.440 --> 31:29.350
are you going to intimidate her

31:29.350 --> 31:30.440
before she even settles in?

31:30.790 --> 31:31.750
But don't you need her

31:31.750 --> 31:33.030
to behave,

31:33.440 --> 31:34.790
so no one impeaches you

31:34.790 --> 31:36.000
for abandoning your own daughter?

31:36.110 --> 31:37.440
"Intimidate" is too strong,

31:37.790 --> 31:38.270
but

31:38.720 --> 31:40.270
since she's returning to this household,

31:41.480 --> 31:42.240
rules

31:42.960 --> 31:44.480
need to be set.

31:46.070 --> 31:46.510
Yes, Sir.

31:46.880 --> 31:47.480
Sir.

31:48.790 --> 31:49.350
Sir.

31:49.920 --> 31:51.590
What's all the panic?

31:51.750 --> 31:52.750
Sir,

31:53.200 --> 31:54.030
word just came

31:54.240 --> 31:55.160
that the Young Lord of Changxing

31:55.160 --> 31:57.030
is coming to our residence.

31:57.480 --> 31:58.550
The Young Lord is coming?

32:00.160 --> 32:00.640
Quick!

32:01.200 --> 32:03.310
Open the main gate to welcome him!

32:03.480 --> 32:03.960
Yes.

32:15.480 --> 32:16.680
He's connected to

32:16.680 --> 32:18.070
the Gu family by marriage,

32:18.550 --> 32:20.240
but his ancestral branches

32:20.510 --> 32:21.880
have never had dealings with us.

32:22.070 --> 32:22.750
Why would he drop by

32:22.750 --> 32:23.590
out of the blue?

32:23.640 --> 32:24.510
How should I know?

32:24.790 --> 32:25.590
The Marquis of Changxing has been

32:25.590 --> 32:27.030
making moves at court lately.

32:27.270 --> 32:28.830
He might see me as someone useful

32:29.030 --> 32:30.240
and sent the heir

32:30.240 --> 32:31.480
to make contact.

32:32.310 --> 32:32.830
Well?

32:33.000 --> 32:33.830
How do I look?

32:34.030 --> 32:34.680
Perfect, perfect.

32:34.720 --> 32:35.350
Take a look for me.

32:35.350 --> 32:35.880
All good?

32:38.110 --> 32:38.830
He's here.

32:47.270 --> 32:50.550
Greetings,

32:50.830 --> 32:52.830
Young Lord.

33:04.590 --> 33:05.720
You?

33:06.310 --> 33:07.510
How dare you!

33:07.680 --> 33:08.200
You...

33:08.480 --> 33:09.110
Gu Jinzhao,

33:09.680 --> 33:10.270
come here.

33:13.310 --> 33:14.240
Young Lord.

33:20.440 --> 33:21.200
Sir.

33:24.550 --> 33:25.720
How dare you

33:26.270 --> 33:27.030
take advantage

33:27.030 --> 33:28.160
of me?

33:28.920 --> 33:29.750
Tell me,

33:30.350 --> 33:31.400
was this little play

33:31.720 --> 33:32.640
amusing to watch?

33:45.880 --> 33:46.830
Greetings,

33:47.350 --> 33:48.880
Young Lord.

33:49.590 --> 33:51.310
Sir, you honor my humble home.

33:51.310 --> 33:53.880
I failed to welcome you properly.

33:55.200 --> 33:56.720
A father bowing to his own daughter?

33:56.960 --> 33:58.240
Truly unheard of

33:58.480 --> 33:59.640
and unprecedented.

34:01.790 --> 34:02.640
Sir,

34:03.000 --> 34:05.070
it is all a misunderstanding.

34:06.350 --> 34:06.960
A misunderstanding?

34:07.750 --> 34:09.000
Are you saying I

34:09.000 --> 34:09.590
have wronged you?

34:10.110 --> 34:10.480
No,

34:10.840 --> 34:11.320
no, no.

34:12.550 --> 34:13.480
I would never dare.

34:13.670 --> 34:14.880
Never.

34:16.000 --> 34:17.630
What a fine daughter you've raised.

34:18.400 --> 34:19.110
She even dares to use

34:19.110 --> 34:21.280
my prestige to bolster her own.

34:21.590 --> 34:22.760
Making a fool of me?

34:23.510 --> 34:24.280
Well...

34:25.030 --> 34:25.550
She...

34:27.550 --> 34:28.550
She was not raised by my side

34:28.920 --> 34:31.320
since young,

34:31.510 --> 34:32.400
and has not been properly disciplined.

34:32.880 --> 34:33.960
If she has offended you,

34:33.960 --> 34:35.590
please grant her your forgiveness.

34:37.880 --> 34:39.360
Not raised by your side?

34:40.030 --> 34:40.880
I've lately heard rumors

34:40.880 --> 34:42.360
that you are accused of

34:42.880 --> 34:44.510
abandoning your own daughter.

34:45.280 --> 34:46.550
I never thought it would be true.

34:46.960 --> 34:47.400
What...

34:48.440 --> 34:50.320
That is mere slander.

34:50.480 --> 34:51.880
Didn't you just say it yourself?

34:56.280 --> 34:57.960
It was a slip of the tongue,

34:57.960 --> 35:00.110
merely a slip of the tongue.

35:00.630 --> 35:01.190
Uncle,

35:01.400 --> 35:02.630
after all, he is my fourth uncle.

35:02.800 --> 35:04.070
There is no need to embarrass him so.

35:07.110 --> 35:07.670
Very well,

35:08.070 --> 35:08.920
that's enough.

35:09.280 --> 35:10.190
I should take my leave.

35:13.550 --> 35:14.400
Leaving already?

35:14.880 --> 35:16.190
I haven't seen enough fun yet.

35:17.800 --> 35:19.710
If I truly humiliate the entire Gu family,

35:20.150 --> 35:21.550
in the end, you'll be the one in trouble,

35:21.880 --> 35:22.670
not me.

35:26.190 --> 35:26.880
Enough.

35:27.280 --> 35:29.190
Since your daughter pleads for you,

35:29.550 --> 35:30.670
you may rise.

35:31.840 --> 35:33.480
Thank you, sir.

35:35.280 --> 35:36.590
My favor

35:37.190 --> 35:38.480
is not so easy to take.

35:56.960 --> 35:57.710
Sir.

35:58.510 --> 35:59.920
What is the Young Lord playing at?

35:59.960 --> 36:01.110
How should I know?

36:01.550 --> 36:02.630
The Young Lord's intentions

36:02.760 --> 36:04.000
are not for us to fathom.

36:05.920 --> 36:06.880
Now go,

36:06.880 --> 36:08.190
have them unload Jinzhao's things.

36:10.230 --> 36:12.070
Didn't you want her at the front courtyard?

36:12.400 --> 36:13.360
What's the point now?

36:13.360 --> 36:14.590
I've already come out to greet her.

36:14.760 --> 36:15.480
Imbecile.

36:19.030 --> 36:19.670
Attendants.

36:19.760 --> 36:20.710
Unload her things.

36:20.880 --> 36:21.630
Yes.

36:22.190 --> 36:22.880
Lan, let's go.

36:22.880 --> 36:23.320
All of you,

36:23.440 --> 36:24.150
carry these down.

36:51.550 --> 36:52.880
Gu Dezhao.

36:53.110 --> 36:53.960
If you disown me,

36:53.960 --> 36:55.440
I'll report you to the authorities!

36:56.960 --> 36:57.880
Such a little girl,

36:58.110 --> 36:58.590
yet she really could

36:58.590 --> 36:59.710
ruin your official fortune?

37:00.480 --> 37:01.840
The prophecy from Priest Qingxu

37:01.840 --> 37:02.840
cannot be false.

37:04.110 --> 37:04.590
Hurry!

37:05.070 --> 37:05.880
Tie her up,

37:06.000 --> 37:06.840
find a cart, and send her off.

37:07.190 --> 37:07.630
Yes.

37:29.800 --> 37:31.480
Mother.

37:34.360 --> 37:35.760
Mother.

37:46.880 --> 37:47.630
Sister.

37:54.030 --> 37:55.710
You must be tired from the journey.

37:56.030 --> 37:57.000
I'm Gu Lan.

37:57.150 --> 37:58.480
Are you and Young Lord

37:58.630 --> 38:00.150
very close?

38:00.590 --> 38:02.000
How do you two know each other?

38:02.320 --> 38:03.800
I heard Father say

38:03.960 --> 38:05.920
he attended your coming-of-age ceremony.

38:10.550 --> 38:11.440
Jinzhao.

39:17.840 --> 39:18.550
Mother.

39:27.880 --> 39:28.590
Ma'am.

39:43.630 --> 39:44.590
What did you call me?

39:51.230 --> 39:52.440
Madam has been waiting for you

39:52.630 --> 39:53.800
since early this morning, Miss.

39:54.030 --> 39:55.280
As soon as word came of your arrival,

39:55.440 --> 39:56.840
she rushed out without even

39:57.000 --> 39:58.000
putting on her outer robe.

40:00.110 --> 40:01.550
She's traveled so far,

40:02.150 --> 40:03.480
and hasn't even sat down yet.

40:04.440 --> 40:05.230
Right.

40:08.510 --> 40:09.590
Let us go inside.

40:38.320 --> 40:39.800
There have been rumors lately

40:40.150 --> 40:42.760
that I abandoned my own daughter.

40:43.590 --> 40:44.880
They are nothing but

40:48.670 --> 40:50.710
sheer nonsense.

40:51.510 --> 40:52.550
But right now

40:52.840 --> 40:54.230
is the official evaluation period.

40:54.920 --> 40:56.440
Such rumors

40:57.320 --> 40:59.360
will only harm my reputation.

41:01.190 --> 41:02.230
On the nineteenth of this month,

41:02.400 --> 41:04.400
the wife of my respected mentor

41:04.400 --> 41:06.480
Lin Xianzhong celebrates her birthday.

41:07.030 --> 41:08.840
You will come with me.

41:09.280 --> 41:11.840
It will be a perfect chance to dispel

41:12.070 --> 41:13.150
these absurd tales.

41:13.840 --> 41:15.510
Just Jinzhao will come with me.

41:15.840 --> 41:17.110
Lan doesn't need to come.

41:17.480 --> 41:18.630
In years past, I've always attended

41:18.630 --> 41:19.800
Madam Lin's birthday feast.

41:19.920 --> 41:21.590
Why can't I go this year?

41:22.360 --> 41:23.360
Just take her.

41:23.920 --> 41:24.760
I don't want to go.

41:24.920 --> 41:26.150
This is social obligation.

41:26.510 --> 41:27.070
It's not something

41:27.070 --> 41:28.480
you get to pick and choose.

41:28.590 --> 41:29.320
But sir, I...

41:31.150 --> 41:31.760
What's wrong?

41:32.280 --> 41:33.360
She burned her hand last night

41:33.360 --> 41:34.550
while personally boiling medicine

41:34.710 --> 41:35.920
for Mrs. Gu.

41:36.070 --> 41:36.550
What...

41:41.710 --> 41:43.150
How could you be so careless?

41:43.150 --> 41:44.280
It really hurts.

41:46.440 --> 41:47.320
It's all red.

41:48.150 --> 41:48.710
Don't we have

41:48.710 --> 41:50.030
kitchen staff?

41:50.400 --> 41:51.440
Why does a concubine

41:51.440 --> 41:52.280
need to decoct medicine herself?

41:52.960 --> 41:54.320
You don't know, Miss?

41:54.630 --> 41:55.920
Ever since Mrs. Gu fell ill,

41:56.440 --> 41:58.280
Ma'am has decocted

41:58.440 --> 42:00.030
and served every dose herself.

42:00.510 --> 42:01.880
Forgive me for speaking out of turn,

42:02.150 --> 42:03.320
but you lived freely and carelessly

42:03.480 --> 42:04.480
in Tongzhou, and even latched onto

42:04.590 --> 42:05.760
someone as high as

42:05.760 --> 42:06.630
the Young Lord.

42:07.070 --> 42:08.030
Now that you're back,

42:08.440 --> 42:09.670
you ought to stay by Madam's bedside

42:09.670 --> 42:10.880
and properly fulfill your filial duties.

42:11.920 --> 42:13.590
What "latching onto the Young Lord"?

42:13.960 --> 42:15.320
Didn't you see, Madam?

42:15.880 --> 42:16.960
Today, Miss

42:17.110 --> 42:18.630
rode back in the same carriage

42:18.630 --> 42:20.320
as the Young Lord of Changxing.

42:21.440 --> 42:22.190
Why

42:22.190 --> 42:23.320
bring that up again?

42:25.800 --> 42:26.710
It's getting late.

42:27.000 --> 42:27.880
All of you, go rest now.

42:31.550 --> 42:32.280
Good night, sir.

42:37.630 --> 42:38.440
Sister,

42:38.760 --> 42:40.400
you and the Young Lord

42:40.550 --> 42:41.960
must be very close, right?

42:42.710 --> 42:43.800
Not really close.

42:44.360 --> 42:45.320
Just

42:45.670 --> 42:46.400
acquaintances.

42:47.440 --> 42:48.360
Really?

42:48.710 --> 42:49.320
Then why would he

42:49.320 --> 42:51.070
let you ride in the same carriage?

42:51.320 --> 42:52.230
He's always been

42:52.360 --> 42:54.030
extremely proud.

42:55.440 --> 42:56.510
I haven't even asked you yet,

42:56.510 --> 42:57.800
yet you question me first.

42:57.960 --> 42:59.360
You have quite a daughter!

42:59.480 --> 43:00.960
An unmarried young lady

43:01.000 --> 43:02.360
riding back in a strange man's carriage.

43:02.550 --> 43:03.840
If word gets out,

43:04.150 --> 43:05.190
where is

43:05.190 --> 43:06.320
my dignity?

43:06.670 --> 43:07.710
Jinzhao said

43:08.230 --> 43:09.400
the carriage broke down.

43:10.190 --> 43:10.760
Broke down?

43:10.920 --> 43:12.230
She could have sent someone for help,

43:12.230 --> 43:13.670
and waited for us to send a carriage!

43:14.110 --> 43:15.670
She did it on purpose!

43:15.920 --> 43:16.800
She rode back in

43:16.800 --> 43:18.000
the Young Lord's carriage

43:18.190 --> 43:19.190
just to make me, her father,

43:19.190 --> 43:19.920
kneel to her

43:20.000 --> 43:20.880
and make a fool of myself.

43:21.630 --> 43:23.230
How can you say that about Jinzhao?

43:26.110 --> 43:27.440
Pay no mind to it.

43:27.840 --> 43:28.760
Sir and Madam fight like this

43:28.760 --> 43:30.000
all the time.

43:30.150 --> 43:31.030
I'm used to it.

43:32.630 --> 43:33.480
Let's go.

43:33.880 --> 43:34.280
This way.

43:39.000 --> 43:40.550
Nanny Zhou was obviously stirring trouble.

43:41.030 --> 43:42.280
As the mistress of the household,

43:42.760 --> 43:44.110
she didn't see it at all.

43:45.320 --> 43:46.320
No wonder it sounded

43:46.320 --> 43:47.510
so wrong to me.

43:48.150 --> 43:49.150
Now that you mention it,

43:49.400 --> 43:50.510
I see it clearly.

43:50.800 --> 43:51.760
That Nanny Zhou

43:51.880 --> 43:52.920
did it deliberately.

43:53.230 --> 43:54.030
She knew full well

43:54.030 --> 43:55.550
Gu Dezhao was angry

43:55.760 --> 43:56.710
about the Young Lord,

43:57.030 --> 43:58.150
and she still brought up the carriage

43:58.320 --> 43:59.230
in front of Madam.

44:00.840 --> 44:01.710
Madam

44:01.960 --> 44:02.960
might tolerate that,

44:03.550 --> 44:04.510
but I won't.

44:09.480 --> 44:10.230
Ow...

44:12.670 --> 44:13.440
You casually

44:14.280 --> 44:16.230
mentioned decocting medicine,

44:16.630 --> 44:17.150
and Jinzhao

44:17.150 --> 44:18.670
kept pressing.

44:19.070 --> 44:20.190
What does she mean by that?

44:20.800 --> 44:21.280
Is she

44:22.230 --> 44:23.190
looking for trouble

44:23.400 --> 44:24.510
with me?

44:26.280 --> 44:27.280
How could that be?

44:27.670 --> 44:28.760
You're overthinking it.

44:29.280 --> 44:29.960
This is the Gu manor,

44:30.030 --> 44:30.960
not the Ji manor.

44:31.190 --> 44:32.320
No place for her to act up.

44:32.320 --> 44:33.000
I get scolded

44:33.000 --> 44:34.030
more than enough every day.

44:34.480 --> 44:35.550
Yet you keep making mistakes all the time!

44:37.000 --> 44:38.880
If she wants trouble, even better.

44:39.070 --> 44:39.760
I was just thinking

44:39.800 --> 44:40.880
of putting her in her place

44:41.070 --> 44:42.190
so she can see clearly

44:42.360 --> 44:43.400
who really runs

44:43.400 --> 44:44.230
this household.

44:50.670 --> 44:52.110
Who's putting whom in their place?

44:52.440 --> 44:54.000
And who exactly is the one in charge here?
